          </div>
        </div>
      </main>

      <footer className="py-6 px-4 gradient-footer" style={{ background: moodGradients.dark }}>
        <div className="container">
          <div className="text-center text-white">
            <p>
              &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Auralize - Duygularınızı Keşfedin
